<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS - West a hit, most flat.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS - West a hit, most flat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most initial public offerings got only a tepid response from Wall Street on Wednesday, but shares of West TeleServices Corp shares surged just over 20 percent in early trading.</p>
<p>The shares rose 3-3/8 to 21-5/8 from their IPO price of $18. The Omaha Nebraska company provides independent teleservices communications.</p>
</text>
